        "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I recently attended an event where there was a unique blend of modern beats with Pacific sounds.\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"I recently attended an event where there was a unique blend of modern beats with Pacific sounds.\",\"output_slot\":\"response\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[\"attended_events\",\"music_preferences\",\"cultural_interests\"],\"execution\":\"compose\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"I recently attended an event where there was a unique blend of modern beats with Pacific sounds.\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"285e6759361b6ccc6c6fd6e377942293ec9581975aa4d55958c07e9d374c3249\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"1a5cad5aa92dac5923599f5494f2ca7d36d73bafd86504212020b448a06a67bb\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"1469b0c7260f64bef3b4bc3eae44c946f599a4c99d3689965b798cc96a9c6963\"},\"variables\":{\"attended_events\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"attended_events\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"music_preferences\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"music_preferences\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"cultural_interests\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"cultural_interests\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"response\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"response\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"attended_events\",\"music_preferences\",\"cultural_interests\",\"response\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"attended_events\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"music_preferences\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"cultural_interests\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"response\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{\"attended_events\":{\"value\":\"The user attended a local electronic music festival featuring Pacific Islander artists, where traditional sounds merged with modern electronic beats. They also attended a festival featuring traditional Pacific music in 2012, which deepened their appreciation of their cultural roots. Additionally, they attended an event with a unique blend of modern beats and Pacific sounds, as mentioned in the original question.\",\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s13\",\"s36\",\"s34\",\"s37\",\"s11\",\"s35\",\"s12\"],\"demand\":\"attended_events\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"music_preferences\":{\"value\":\"The user has a strong and active interest in blending modern music (electronic beats, remixes) with traditional Pacific Islander sounds (ukulele, pahu drum, Pacific drums). They have personally experimented with this fusion in a studio (2013), produced an electronic track incorporating Pacific samples, remixed a popular track with traditional Pacific instruments, attended a festival featuring Pacific Islander artists in an electronic music context, joined an online group dedicated to Pacific musical innovations, and watched a documentary on the history and modern adaptations of Pacific Islander music. They describe the fusion as a 'game changer' and a way to connect with their roots and explore creativity.\",\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s22\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s56\",\"s3\",\"s5\",\"s57\",\"s47\",\"s11\",\"s58\"],\"demand\":\"music_preferences\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"cultural_interests\":{\"value\":\"The user has a deep and sustained interest in Pacific Islander music and its fusion with modern electronic and Latin beats. They have attended festivals featuring traditional Pacific music (2012) and a local electronic music festival with Pacific Islander artists. They have sampled traditional Pacific Islander music in a studio (2013) and produced an electronic track blending modern beats with Pacific sounds. They also joined an online group dedicated to Pacific musical innovations and watched a documentary on the history and modern adaptations of Pacific Islander music. They actively experiment with blending traditional Pacific instruments (ukulele, pahu drum) with Latin rhythms (salsa, bossa nova) and electronic elements, describing it as a transformative and culturally unifying experience.\",\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s22\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s26\",\"s13\",\"s3\",\"s5\",\"s36\",\"s34\",\"s37\",\"s47\",\"s11\",\"s35\",\"s23\",\"s12\",\"s25\"],\"demand\":\"cultural_interests\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_b467800762dbf849ecbe2ff5\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user attended a local electronic music festival featuring Pacific Islander artists, where traditional sounds merged with modern electronic beats. They also attended a festival featuring traditional Pacific music in 2012, which deepened their appreciation of their cultural roots. Additionally, they attended an event with a unique blend of modern beats and Pacific sounds, as mentioned in the original question.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s13\",\"s36\",\"s34\",\"s37\",\"s11\",\"s35\",\"s12\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly describes attending a local electronic music festival with Pacific Islander artists (s11–s13) and a 2012 festival featuring traditional Pacific music (s34–s37). The original question also references an event with a blend of modern beats and Pacific sounds, which is consistent with these accounts.\",\"variable\":\"attended_events\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"},{\"id\":\"fact_2bc16da1bdea6e9e11a8949d\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a strong and active interest in blending modern music (electronic beats, remixes) with traditional Pacific Islander sounds (ukulele, pahu drum, Pacific drums). They have personally experimented with this fusion in a studio (2013), produced an electronic track incorporating Pacific samples, remixed a popular track with traditional Pacific instruments, attended a festival featuring Pacific Islander artists in an electronic music context, joined an online group dedicated to Pacific musical innovations, and watched a documentary on the history and modern adaptations of Pacific Islander music. They describe the fusion as a 'game changer' and a way to connect with their roots and explore creativity.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s22\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s56\",\"s3\",\"s5\",\"s57\",\"s47\",\"s11\",\"s58\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"Multiple user statements across five conversations consistently demonstrate a deep, hands-on engagement with the fusion of modern and Pacific music, including studio work, track production, festival attendance, community participation, and documentary viewing. The user explicitly calls the blend a 'game changer' and describes it as connecting to their roots.\",\"variable\":\"music_preferences\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"},{\"id\":\"fact_64a89d2e361a4303d4af5e8a\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a deep and sustained interest in Pacific Islander music and its fusion with modern electronic and Latin beats. They have attended festivals featuring traditional Pacific music (2012) and a local electronic music festival with Pacific Islander artists. They have sampled traditional Pacific Islander music in a studio (2013) and produced an electronic track blending modern beats with Pacific sounds. They also joined an online group dedicated to Pacific musical innovations and watched a documentary on the history and modern adaptations of Pacific Islander music. They actively experiment with blending traditional Pacific instruments (ukulele, pahu drum) with Latin rhythms (salsa, bossa nova) and electronic elements, describing it as a transformative and culturally unifying experience.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s22\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s26\",\"s13\",\"s3\",\"s5\",\"s36\",\"s34\",\"s37\",\"s47\",\"s11\",\"s35\",\"s23\",\"s12\",\"s25\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"Multiple user statements across five conversations consistently describe active engagement with Pacific Islander music: attending festivals (2012 traditional festival, recent electronic festival with Pacific artists), sampling and producing music (2013 studio work, producing a fusion track), joining an online community, and watching a documentary. The user also describes ongoing experimentation with blending Pacific and Latin rhythms. All sources are user statements (source_role=user) providing direct evidence of past experiences and interests.\",\"variable\":\"cultural_interests\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"},{\"id\":\"fact_afe820d5952c5bcd3bf2192f\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"It's great to see such innovative approaches in music. I imagine it must have been quite an experience for anyone who loves unique blends or eclectic sounds.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s22\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s56\",\"s26\",\"s13\",\"s3\",\"s5\",\"s36\",\"s34\",\"s37\",\"s57\",\"s47\",\"s11\",\"s58\",\"s35\",\"s23\",\"s12\",\"s25\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{\"attended_events\":1,\"music_preferences\":1,\"cultural_interests\":1},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"